    "extraction_notes": [
      "PDF SHA-256 verified as dc9fbbd295ab338ef187e9bbe46e54562b5d5259dfb4805f59bdb1003c0b64b4.",
      "The device is explicitly labeled N-CHANNEL MOSFET; polarity is n.",
      "Maximum ratings: VDS = 20 V; VGS = plus or minus 10 V; ID = 5.5 A steady state at Ta = 25 degC on a 1 inch by 1 inch FR4 board; IDM = 20 A pulsed; PD = 1.2 W; RthetaJA = 104 K/W; TJ and TSTG = -55 to +150 degC.",
      "IDSS maximum is 1.0 uA at VDS = 20 V, VGS = 0 V, Ta = 25 degC; page 2 Static Parameter Characteristics, IDSS, MAX column.",
      "IGSS maximum is plus or minus 100 nA at VGS = plus or minus 8.0 V, VDS = 0 V, Ta = 25 degC; page 2 Static Parameter Characteristics, IGSS, MAX column.",
      "RDS(ON) maximum values for the three published conditions are 0.025 ohm at VGS = 4.5 V and ID = 4.5 A, 0.032 ohm at VGS = 2.5 V and ID = 3.0 A, and 0.049 ohm at VGS = 1.8 V and ID = 2.7 A; page 2 Static Parameter Characteristics, MAX column.",
      "Forward transconductance gfs typical is 40 S at VDS = 15 V and ID = 5.0 A; page 2 Static Parameter Characteristics.",
      "Dynamic table conditions are VDS = 10 V, VGS = 0 V, f = 1 MHz, Ta = 25 degC. Ciss = 418 pF, Coss = 82 pF, and Crss = 70 pF.",
      "Gate charge typical values are Qg = 6.0 nC, Qgs = 1.0 nC, and Qgd = 2.0 nC at VDS = 10 V, ID = 4.5 A, VGS = 4.5 V; page 2 Switching Parameters.",
      "Reverse recovery time trr is 13 ns typical and 25 ns maximum at IF = 1.0 A and di/dt = -100 A/us; page 2 Switching Parameters.",
      "Diode forward voltage maximum is 1.2 V at IS = 4.5 A and VGS = 0 V; page 2 Static Parameter Characteristics.",
      "Thermal data publishes RthetaJA = 104 K/W for steady-state surface mounting; no RthetaJC value is published, page 1 Maximum Ratings.",
      "Curve points are direct digitized readings from the supplied plots. No interpolation was used. Fig. 1, Fig. 2, and Fig. 5 are on page 3."
    ],
